# Copy to pigeonhole.env (gitignored) for the Docker path and fill in the
# secret. The systemd unit does not read this file: it takes the same value
# through LoadCredential= so it never sits in the process environment.
#
# Same value as dovecote's COAP_SERVICE_SECRET Worker secret. One value, one
# gate, whatever each side calls it.
PIGEONHOLE_SERVICE_SECRET=
